<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 70.4551 per dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 70.4551 per dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 70.4551 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 70.3067 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 4		   Nov 1</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  70.4551		 70.3067</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	 8.415		   8.575</p>
<p>    tenge per mark	    46.4000		 46.4571</p>
<p>    volume (DM million)	0.200		   0.070</p>
<p>--Almaty newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
